🚽 Test case: STDROT_PTR round-trips in both directions -- as a native
🚽 parameter (poke_int/peek_int write and read through an opaque address)
🚽 and as a native return value (test_ptr_source), including dereferencing
🚽 a pointer a native handed back, not just one Brainrot already owned.
skibidi main {
    rizz value = 10;
    poke_int(&value, 99);
    yapping("%d", value);
    yapping("%d", peek_int(&value));

    rizz *p = test_ptr_source();
    poke_int(p, 7);
    yapping("%d", peek_int(p));
    yapping("%d", *p);
    bussin 0;
}
